$DATUM General Preparation for Brominating Dihydropyrimidone 2 A mixture of
dihydropyrimidinone 1 (2 mmol) and dioxane dibromide (2.2 mmol) in
dioxane (5 mL) was stirred for 5 h at rt. The reaction mixture was washed
with aqueous sodium thiosulfate and aqueous sodium hydrogensulfite, and
the solvent was removed to give the crude product, which was
recrystallized in ethanol. 2, yield 88%.
