$DATUM Bromination of alkylnaphthazarine IIe with N-bromosuccinimide. A solution
of 72 mg (0.22 mmol) of compound IIe, 80 mg (0.36 mmol) of
N-bromo-succinimide, and 2 mg of AIBN in 12 ml of CCl4 was boiled for 2
h, the solvent was removed, and the residue was crystallized from
ethanol. 72 mg (83%) of compound IIIe.
